Subject: [PATCH 409/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0408: a stop
 during the reactivation wait ends the take

A restart that waited for the audio session reactivation could not be cancelled, so Esc or a disabled composer in that window left the take listening with no recognizer. The wait now cancels like the old-end wait. A newer restart keeps its own start flag, a mark set during an in-flight reactivation survives, the stall clocks start at the real recognizer start, and the voice log field is now reactivatePending.
